      0 360 arc h
      dup dx mul x0 add exch dup dy mul y0 add exch dr mul r0 add
      360 0 arcn h f
    } {
      2 copy
      dup dx mul x0 add exch dup dy mul y0 add exch dr mul r0 add
      a1 a2 arcn
      dup dx mul x0 add exch dup dy mul y0 add exch dr mul r0 add
      a2 a1 arcn h
      dup dx mul x0 add exch dup dy mul y0 add exch dr mul r0 add
      a1 a2 arc
